NewOpenModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Opens a new empty block with the given id in the blocks list (creates an {id, instrs:[], term:null} record) and returns {blocks, openIdx} — the updated list and the open-block index.
    Provides: NewOpen(blocks, id) -> out.
    Composition: Native include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../NewOpen/NewOpen.sir).
